+and recognizes the complete scene: legal dimensions/colors, one connected
+nonrectangular color-1 template, and one corner key. Default aligned four-pair
+blocks now schedule `[query-key, next, next, query-key]`; generated templates are
+redrawn until all four rotations differ. `rule_mirror`, `observe_overrides`, and
+`lesson_identifiable` make the contract executable. Canonical acceptance is
+preserved; one official zig-zag template is 180-degree symmetric, so rotational
+asymmetry is enforced for generated lessons rather than all canonical inputs.
